<Page title="About" description="Credits and the Fan Content Policy notice.">
  <article>
    <p class="kicker">Credits and notices</p>
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p class="lede">Nomicon Fonts records the printed shape of the text face used on trading cards by stacking many scanned copies of each letter.</p>
    <h2>Credits</h2>
    <p>Card data from MTGJSON. The page text is set in EB Garamond (SIL OFL 1.1) as a stand-in until Nomicon Rules exists.</p>
    <h2>Fan Content Policy</h2>
    <p>Nomicon Fonts is unofficial Fan Content permitted under the Fan Content Policy. Portions of the materials used are property of Wizards of the Coast. ©Wizards of the Coast LLC.</p>
  </article>
</Page>
